  "claim": "The university that Elisa Roberts received her received her Bachelor of Arts from, was established before Purbanchal University.",
  "evidencia": "Page: University of New South Wales. Sentence: The University of New South Wales (UNSW; branded as UNSW Sydney) is an Australian public research university located in the Sydney suburb of Kensington.\nPage: University of New South Wales. Sentence: Established in 1949, it is regarded as one of the world's leading universities, ranked 3rd in Australia, 45th in the world, and 1st in New South Wales according to the 2017 \"QS World University Rankings\".\nPage: Purbanchal University. Sentence: It was established in 1993 by the government of Nepal.\nPage: Elisa Roberts. Sentence: Born in Sydney, she served with the Australian Defence Force at Victoria Barracks in Paddington from 1989 to 1993, and received her Bachelor of Arts from the University of New South Wales in 1996.",
