        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "11cdd346-04c1-5de8-9ec6-b35ebfbe14a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of New South Wales, Purbanchal University, Australian Defence Force\n- Places: Sydney, Kensington, Paddington, New South Wales, Nepal\n- People: Elisa Roberts\n- Topics: university establishment, rankings, education, military service\n\nFacts:\n- The University of New South Wales is an Australian public research university located in Kensington, a suburb of Sydney.\n- The University of New South Wales was established in 1949.\n- Elisa Roberts served with the Australian Defence Force at Victoria Barracks in Paddington from 1989 to 1993.\n- Purbanchal University was established in 1993 by the government of Nepal.\n- Elisa Roberts received a Bachelor of Arts from the University of New South Wales in 1996.\n- In the 2017 QS World University Rankings, the University of New South Wales was ranked 3rd in Australia, 45th in the world, and 1st in New South Wales.",
